{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-zec-3-1","title":"Zechariah 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Under the type of Joshua, the high priest, receiving clean garments, 6 and a covenant of promise, 8 Christ the Branch and Corner Stone is promised.</p>\n<p>he. 1:9,13,19; 2:3 Joshua. 8; 6:11; Ezr 5:2; Hag 1:1,12; 2:4 standing. De 10:8; 18:15; 1Sa 6:20; 2Ch 29:11; Ps 106:23; Jer 15:19 Eze 44:11,15; Lu 21:36 the angel. Ge 48:16; Ex 3:2-6; 23:20,21; Ho 12:4,5; Mal 3:1; Ac 7:30-38 Satan. that is, an adversary. Job 1:6-12; 2:1-8; Ps 109:6; *marg: Lu 22:31; 1Pe 5:8; Re 12:9,10 resist him. Heb. be his adversary. Ge 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-2","title":"Zechariah 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>the Lord said. Ps 109:31; Lu 22:32; Ro 16:20; 1Jo 3:8 The Lord rebuke. Da 12:1; Mr 1:25; Lu 4:35; 9:42; Jude 1:9; Re 12:9,10 chosen. 1:17; 2:12; 2Ch 6:6; Joh 13:18; Ro 8:33; Re 17:14 a brand. Am 4:11; Ro 11:4,5; Jude 1:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-3","title":"Zechariah 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>2Ch 30:18-20; Ezr 9:15; Isa 64:6; Da 9:18; Mt 22:11-13 Re 7:13,14; 19:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-4","title":"Zechariah 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>those. 1,7; 1Ki 22:19; Isa 6:2,3; Lu 1:19; Re 5:11 Take. Isa 43:25; Eze 36:25; Ga 3:27,28; Php 3:7-9; Re 7:14 I have. 2Sa 12:13; Ps 32:1,2; 51:9; Isa 6:5-7; Joh 1:29; Ro 6:23; Heb 8:12 and I will. Isa 61:3,10; Lu 15:22; Ro 3:22; 1Co 6:11; 2Co 5:21; Col 3:10 Re 19:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-5","title":"Zechariah 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>fair. 6:11; Ex 28:2-4; 29:6; Le 8:6-9; Heb 2:8,9; Re 4:4,10; 5:8-14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-6","title":"Zechariah 3:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the. 1; Ge 22:15,16; 28:13-17; 48:15,16; Ex 23:20,21; Isa 63:9; Ho 12:4 Ac 7:35-38 protested. Jer 11:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-7","title":"Zechariah 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>if thou wilt keep. Ge 26:5; Le 8:35; 10:3; 1Ki 2:3; 1Ch 23:32; Eze 44:8,15,16; 48:11 1Ti 6:13,14; 2Ti 4:1,2 charge. or, ordinance. judge. De 17:8-13; 1Sa 2:28-30; Jer 15:19-21; Mal 2:5-7; Mt 19:28 Lu 22:30; 1Co 6:2,3; Re 3:21 I will. 1:8-11; 4:14; 6:5; Lu 20:35,36; Joh 14:2; Heb 12:22,23; Re 5:9-14 places. Heb. walks. Re 3:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-8","title":"Zechariah 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>for. Ps 71:7; Isa 8:18; 20:3; 1Co 4:9-13 wondered at. Heb. of wonder, or sign, as. Eze 12:11; 24:24 my. Isa 42:1; 49:3,5; 52:13; 53:11; Eze 34:23,24; 37:24; Php 2:6-8 the Branch. 6:12; Isa 4:2; 11:1; 53:2; Jer 23:5; 33:15; Eze 17:22-24; 34:29 Lu 1:78; *marg:</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-9","title":"Zechariah 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the stone. Ps 118:22; Isa 8:14,15; 28:16; Mt 21:42-44; Ac 4:11; Ro 9:33 1Pe 2:4-8 seven. 4:10; 2Ch 16:9; Re 5:6 I will engrave. Ex 28:11,21,36; Joh 6:27; 2Co 1:22; 3:3; 2Ti 2:19 remove. 13:1; Isa 53:4-12; Jer 31:34; 50:20; Da 9:24-27; Mic 7:18,19 Joh 1:29; Eph 2:16,17; Col 1:20,21; 1Ti 2:5,6; Heb 7:27; 9:25,26 Heb 10:10-18; 1Jo 2:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-zec-3-10","title":"Zechariah 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"ZEC","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>In. 2:11 shall. 1Ki 4:25; Isa 36:16; Ho 2:18; Mic 4:4; Joh 1:45-48</p>"}]}